	<h1>Getting started</h1>
	<norn-rich-text>
		<p id="overview">An overview of the project and what it does.</p>
		<p>Install the project, then run it once to see it work. The steps below take a few minutes on a new machine.</p>
		<p id="setup">Set up the project folder before the first build.</p>
		<p>The package needs Node 24 or later. Check the version with <code>node --version</code> first.</p>
		<p id="tokens">Design tokens set the colors, the type, and the spacing.</p>
		<p>Override a token in the project's own stylesheet, and every component follows it.</p>
		<p id="usage">Import the package and call it with a name.</p>
		<p>It returns the greeting as a string, and keeps no state between calls.</p>
	</norn-rich-text>
</norn-sidebar-layout>
